 </span><span begin="00:50.230" end="00:51.100">hour</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.100" end="00:53.260"><span begin="00:51.100" end="00:51.580">Just </span><span begin="00:51.580" end="00:53.260">because</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.470" end="00:57.070"><span begin="00:53.470" end="00:53.680">I'm </span><span begin="00:53.680" end="00:54.130">never </span><span begin="00:54.130" end="00:54.640">happy </span><span begin="00:54.640" end="00:54.970">when </span><span begin="00:54.970" end="00:55.120">I'm </span><span begin="00:55.120" end="00:55.810">sobered </span><span begin="00:55.810" end="00:57.070">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.430" end="01:00.430"><span begin="00:57.430" end="00:57.790">I'm </span><span begin="00:57.790" end="00:58.150">only </span><span begin="00:58.150" end="00:58.570">good </span><span begin="00:58.570" end="00:58.780">if </span><span begin="00:58.780" end="00:58.930">I </span><span begin="00:58.930" end="00:59.170">can </span><span begin="00:59.170" end="00:59.560">have </span><span begin="00:59.560" end="00:59.650">a </span><span begin="00:59.650" end="01:00.430">cup</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.430" end="01:02.770"><span begin="01:00.430" end="01:00.730">Some </span><span begin="01:00.730" end="01:01.030">days </span><span begin="01:01.030" end="01:01.270">I'm </span><span begin="01:01.270" end="01:01.570">sweet </span><span begin="01:01.570" end="01:01.690">and </span><span begin="01:01.690" end="01:01.990">some </span><span begin="01:01.990" end="01:02.170">I'm </span><span begin="01:02.170" end="01:02.770">sour</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.950" end="01:07.000"><span begin="01:02.950" end="01:03.250">But </span><span begin="01:03.250" end="01:03.430">I </span><span begin="01:03.430" end="01:03.730">can't </span><span begin="01:03.730" end="01:03.970">help </span><span begin="01:03.970" end="01:04.210">but </span><span begin="01:04.210" end="01:04.480">drink </span><span begin="